VoxtMini derives from Auralink (https://github.com/hehehai/Auralink) at
commit 748cf55, by the same author, who licenses that code for VoxtMini
under the Apache License 2.0: almost all of VoxtMini's Go code, the Swift
helper, its tests and its documentation started there, and were renamed
and stripped of Auralink's remote services (docs/architecture.md, §5).

Voxt, named below as a source, is the Swift app this repository held
before VoxtMini: its code is in this repository's history up to the tag
voxt-final (https://github.com/hehehai/voxt now leads here), Copyright
the Voxt authors, licensed under the Apache License 2.0.

