OpenCC conversion tables
  internal/hans/t2s.txt, the table that writes Traditional Chinese in
  Simplified characters, is generated by internal/hans/gen.go from the
  dictionaries of OpenCC (Open Chinese Convert,
  https://github.com/BYVoid/OpenCC) at tag ver.1.4.2: TSCharacters.txt,
  TSPhrases.txt and part of TWVariantsRevPhrases.txt, with a few entries
  of TWVariants.txt and HKVariants.txt reversed. Copyright Carbo Kuo
  (BYVoid) and the OpenCC contributors, licensed under the Apache License
  2.0 (LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt). Only the first candidate of each entry
  is kept, its value resolved through the others, and a few phrases are
  VoxtMini's own (gen.go's keeps).

Speech samples
  testdata/speech/sample-zh-en.wav and the eval clips testdata/eval/*.wav
  are synthetic speech made with Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-0.6B-CustomVoice (Alibaba
  Qwen, Apache-2.0), which puts no condition on its outputs; they are
  distributed with VoxtMini under VoxtMini's licence.
  testdata/speech/README.md and docs/eval.md say how they were made.
  helper/Fixtures/audio/tone-22050-stereo.wav is a generated sine tone.

